nds of music and video releases via RabbitMQ queues. Built QA systems based off of third-party offerings like Audible Magics content identification system. Authored webhook systems for the third-party integration of systems including RunDeck and HelloSign allowing the company to automate new user signup and onboarding and content Developed REST APIs to allow the creation of small React and Angular.js internal sites to help operations staff with issues like creating SSH keys for clients. Show less", "is_current_experience": false}], "type": "company-experiences"}, {"company_info": {"name": "Venntro Media Group", "domain": "venntro.com", "website": "http://www.venntro.com/", "linkedin_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/venntro-media-group", "linkedin_slug": "venntro-media-group", "crunchbase_url": "https://www.crunchbase.com/organization/venntro-media-company", "social_urls": ["https://www.facebook.com/venntro", "https://www.instagram.com/venntro", "https://www.linkedin.com/company/venntro-media-group/", "https://www.twitter.com/venntro", "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCjkMxZc7E_gxyPOqbNDchnQ", "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCjkMxZc7E_gxyPOqbNDchnQ/videos"], "short_address": "The Switch 1-7 The Grove Slough, England SL1 1QP, GB", "locations": ["The Switch 1-7 The Grove Slough, England SL1 1QP, GB"], "type": "company-info", "description": "As part of our commitment to entrepreneurial growth,  Venntro Ventures offers investment and advice for dating and lifestyle start-ups.

